    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Pursuant to the Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated as of August 1, 2026, by and among Indivior Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (&quot;Indivior&quot;), Artemis Merger Sub Inc. and Supernus Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (&quot;Supernus Pharmaceuticals&quot;), at the effective time of the merger on 11/2/2026, each outstanding Supernus Pharmaceuticals equity award was assumed by Indivior (renamed Supernus, Inc.) and automatically converted into a corresponding Supernus, Inc. equity award covering the number of Supernus, Inc. shares equal to the number of Supernus Pharmaceuticals shares subject to the award multiplied by the 1.5401 exchange ratio (rounded down), with the per-share exercise price divided by the exchange ratio and rounded up to the nearest whole cent. Each converted award is subject to substantially the same terms and conditions, including vesting, that applied immediately prior to the effective time, except that performance stock unit awards were converted into time-vesting restricted stock units.</footnote>
